  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──小糸",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090010,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "022",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おめでとう、小糸\r\n優勝だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………あの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん、\r\n最初にわたしに言ってくれましたよね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "どんなアイドルになりたいか\r\nそれを考えるのが、わたしの一番最初の課題だって",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "008",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "えっとですね……\r\n前にも言いましたけど、わたし最初は…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "みんなといれなくなったら、\r\nまた居場所が無くなっちゃうって思って……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だからアイドル……\r\nやらなきゃって思ったんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "それから──……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090080"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ひとりでいる時は、いつも考えてました",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090090"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたしみたいに……なんとなく\r\n自分に居場所が無いって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090100"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そんなふうに思う人はきっと\r\nいっぱいいるんじゃないかなって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だけどわたしを応援していれば、ライブに来れば、\r\n仲間がいっぱいいて楽しいって──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そういう場所が、みんなの……\r\nううん、みんなとわたしの居場所になったらいいなって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090130"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "もし、もしもわたしが\r\nそういうアイドルになれたらって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──それが、\r\n一番最初の課題の答えなんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……はい\r\nこれで……合ってますか……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろん\r\n小糸がそう思ったなら、それが正解だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、でもひとつだけ間違ってるかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "えっ、な、なんですか……！？\r\nわたし間違えちゃいましたか……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸はもう、なってるよ\r\n……そういうアイドルに、もうなってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……えっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日も会場に来てくれてただろ\r\n……小糸を応援してくれてるファンが",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "はい……あの……\r\nプロデューサーさんも……見ましたか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、見たよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸を見てると頑張ろうって思える\r\n一生懸命な姿が、誰かを元気にできると思った",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンも、メンバーのみんなも\r\nもちろん俺も、小糸に元気を貰ってる",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……小糸はもう、ちゃんとアイドルだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "言っただろ\r\n──小糸はアイドルに、向いてる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090220"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そんなの、当然ですよ……っ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090230"
  },
  {
    "id": 6022001090240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたしは、アイドル……\r\n２８３プロのアイドル、福丸小糸なんですから……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/602200109/6022001090240"
  },
